1
00:00:59,520 --> 00:01:00,320
Three female ghosts.

2
00:01:01,240 --> 00:01:02,240
Come out yourselves.

3
00:01:06,120 --> 00:01:06,719
Inspector Mu.

4
00:01:07,280 --> 00:01:08,840
We did the killing and played the ghosts.

5
00:01:10,079 --> 00:01:11,159
It doesn't involve Chunmei and the rest.

6
00:01:11,680 --> 00:01:13,920
You three are from the Acrobatic troupe.

7
00:01:16,280 --> 00:01:16,959
All of you,

8
00:01:17,439 --> 00:01:18,439
Explain yourselves right now.

9
00:01:19,159 --> 00:01:20,840
Who is the real killer?

10
00:01:26,680 --> 00:01:27,760
Who exactly are you people?

11
00:01:29,840 --> 00:01:30,719
Do you still remember

12
00:01:31,159 --> 00:01:32,120
this house?

13
00:01:32,439 --> 00:01:34,040
Whose home was it two years ago?

14
00:01:43,239 --> 00:01:43,760
Chunmei!

15
00:01:43,920 --> 00:01:44,319
Chunmei!

16
00:01:45,200 --> 00:01:45,840
What's wrong, Chunmei?

17
00:01:47,319 --> 00:01:47,799
Erzhu!

18
00:01:49,280 --> 00:01:49,799
Are you okay, Erzhu?

19
00:01:49,879 --> 00:01:51,120
Kids, don't panic.

20
00:01:51,400 --> 00:01:53,359
Quickly cover her mouth and nose.

21
00:01:55,680 --> 00:01:56,120
Come.

22
00:01:56,439 --> 00:01:57,599
Hurry, cover her mouth and nose.

23
00:01:57,719 --> 00:01:58,719
Let's go. Come home with me.

24
00:01:59,400 --> 00:02:00,319
Hold her steady.

25
00:02:00,560 --> 00:02:00,840
Come on.

26
00:02:00,920 --> 00:02:01,519
Erzhu.

27
00:02:01,879 --> 00:02:02,560
This way.

28
00:02:02,959 --> 00:02:03,359
Come.

29
00:02:06,120 --> 00:02:06,599
Here.

30
00:02:06,719 --> 00:02:07,719
We're home. We're home.

31
00:02:09,000 --> 00:02:09,800
Help her sit down quickly.

32
00:02:09,960 --> 00:02:10,520
Grandpa.

33
00:02:11,080 --> 00:02:12,199
Who are they?

34
00:02:12,479 --> 00:02:14,120
They inhaled Miasma in the mountains.

35
00:02:14,199 --> 00:02:15,120
Boil some water quickly.

36
00:02:15,240 --> 00:02:16,240
Grandpa will clear their poison.

37
00:02:16,360 --> 00:02:17,639
Come on, help her sit down.

38
00:02:17,639 --> 00:02:18,120
Okay.

39
00:02:20,919 --> 00:02:21,400
Chunmei.

40
00:02:25,159 --> 00:02:25,599
Little sister.

41
00:02:26,159 --> 00:02:27,280
Sister, take your medicine.

42
00:02:32,800 --> 00:02:33,240
Here.

43
00:02:40,719 --> 00:02:41,400
Feeling better?

44
00:02:43,199 --> 00:02:43,960
You'll be fine.

45
00:02:44,800 --> 00:02:46,199
Weren't we in the mountains?

46
00:02:46,960 --> 00:02:47,759
Where are we?

47
00:02:48,879 --> 00:02:49,719
Here's what happened.

48
00:02:49,960 --> 00:02:50,639
You guys...

49
00:02:50,800 --> 00:02:52,599
Lucky I was picking herbs up here.

50
00:02:52,919 --> 00:02:54,520
There's Miasma on this mountain.

51
00:02:54,960 --> 00:02:56,199
You were all poisoned by the Miasma.

52
00:02:56,560 --> 00:02:58,159
You barely made it out alive.

53
00:03:01,800 --> 00:03:02,280
Thank you.

54
00:03:03,000 --> 00:03:04,520
Thank you for saving our lives, Doctor.

55
00:03:05,439 --> 00:03:06,199
Alright, alright.

56
00:03:06,360 --> 00:03:07,319
Come on, sit down quickly.

57
00:03:07,560 --> 00:03:08,120
Come, come.

58
00:03:09,560 --> 00:03:10,639
You didn't know.

59
00:03:11,360 --> 00:03:13,680
Lijia Town is deep in the mountains.

60
00:03:14,639 --> 00:03:16,360
There's Miasma on this mountain.

61
00:03:16,719 --> 00:03:18,599
Even the hunters from our own town

62
00:03:18,800 --> 00:03:20,039
don't dare go up there to hunt.

63
00:03:20,919 --> 00:03:22,400
Looking at you siblings,

64
00:03:23,280 --> 00:03:25,080
you must be from out of town, right?

65
00:03:27,439 --> 00:03:28,280
There's a war in the north,

66
00:03:29,039 --> 00:03:30,719
so we had to flee south.

67
00:03:32,159 --> 00:03:33,479
My eldest brother is a factory guard.

68
00:03:34,360 --> 00:03:34,719
Nice to meet you.

69
00:03:34,719 --> 00:03:35,879
I'm a worker at a chemical plant.

70
00:03:36,639 --> 00:03:37,319
And this is my little sister.

71
00:03:37,719 --> 00:03:38,840
She works at a textile mill.

72
00:03:40,520 --> 00:03:41,719
These days,

73
00:03:42,439 --> 00:03:43,680
with all the chaos of war,

74
00:03:44,400 --> 00:03:46,560
it's much more peaceful here in the mountains.

75
00:03:48,159 --> 00:03:49,280
How about this?

76
00:03:49,599 --> 00:03:50,479
You siblings

77
00:03:50,599 --> 00:03:53,159
can stay with me for the time being.

78
00:03:53,240 --> 00:03:53,840
You see,

79
00:03:53,960 --> 00:03:56,159
It's just me and my little grandson here.

80
00:03:56,520 --> 00:03:57,840
It gets pretty lonely.

81
00:03:58,159 --> 00:04:00,000
Having you siblings to keep me company

82
00:04:00,319 --> 00:04:02,360
would make me very happy.

83
00:04:02,719 --> 00:04:03,400
Well...

84
00:04:04,560 --> 00:04:05,560
Wouldn't that be an imposition?

85
00:04:08,120 --> 00:04:09,360
My eldest brother can do carpentry,

86
00:04:09,800 --> 00:04:10,840
my second brother can grow flowers,

87
00:04:11,800 --> 00:04:12,599
and I can do needlework.

88
00:04:13,199 --> 00:04:14,319
So please let us stay.

89
00:04:14,439 --> 00:04:15,960
Let us repay you for saving our lives.

90
00:04:16,720 --> 00:04:17,519
There's no need for repayment.

91
00:04:17,839 --> 00:04:18,839
There's no need for repayment.

92
00:04:23,199 --> 00:04:24,319
I told you, Xiao Bao,

93
00:04:24,839 --> 00:04:26,439
that's my acupuncture dummy,

94
00:04:26,519 --> 00:04:27,639
not your toy.

95
00:04:27,800 --> 00:04:29,399
Look, you broke it again!

96
00:04:29,959 --> 00:04:30,759
It's fine, Benefactor.

97
00:04:31,399 --> 00:04:32,199
I know carpentry.

98
00:04:32,399 --> 00:04:33,480
I'll make you a new one later.

99
00:04:34,079 --> 00:04:35,199
I'd appreciate that. Thank you.

100
00:04:37,680 --> 00:04:38,319
Hurry up!

101
00:04:39,560 --> 00:04:40,240
Move faster, all of you!

102
00:04:41,000 --> 00:04:41,560
Did you hear me?

103
00:04:43,759 --> 00:04:44,439
Hurry up!

104
00:04:47,360 --> 00:04:48,920
I said hurry up! Faster!

105
00:04:50,160 --> 00:04:50,680
Little sister!

106
00:04:50,800 --> 00:04:51,279
Little sister!

107
00:04:51,839 --> 00:04:52,399
Little sister!

108
00:04:53,160 --> 00:04:53,879
Have some pity.

109
00:04:54,240 --> 00:04:56,079
Please give us a bite to eat.

110
00:04:56,279 --> 00:04:57,480
We're tired and hungry.

111
00:04:57,600 --> 00:04:58,879
We really can't walk anymore.

112
00:04:59,319 --> 00:05:00,360
You want food?

113
00:05:01,199 --> 00:05:03,000
Stop wasting my food!

114
00:05:03,639 --> 00:05:04,279
Once we get to town,

115
00:05:04,399 --> 00:05:05,879
I'm going to sell every single one of you!

116
00:05:06,839 --> 00:05:08,120
Little bastards!

117
00:05:08,279 --> 00:05:08,759
Hurry up!

118
00:05:09,800 --> 00:05:10,279
Move!

119
00:05:10,839 --> 00:05:11,600
Move it!

120
00:05:19,639 --> 00:05:20,839
Don't be afraid, kids.

121
00:05:21,079 --> 00:05:21,920
Hurry, come with me.

122
00:05:26,680 --> 00:05:27,279
Look at this.

123
00:05:27,759 --> 00:05:29,319
When writing this stroke,

124
00:05:29,360 --> 00:05:29,959
do it like this.

125
00:05:30,879 --> 00:05:32,240
We were homeless,

126
00:05:32,680 --> 00:05:34,319
but Elder Ding took us all in.

127
00:05:35,560 --> 00:05:37,240
We finally had a home.

128
00:05:37,279 --> 00:05:37,759
Careful, don't fall.

129
00:05:37,759 --> 00:05:38,839
Grandpa rescued us from

130
00:05:39,000 --> 00:05:40,040
those human traffickers.

131
00:05:40,439 --> 00:05:42,439
From now on, he's our real Grandpa.

132
00:05:42,800 --> 00:05:43,959
We have a family now, too.

133
00:05:44,120 --> 00:05:45,120
We'll never have to go hungry again.

134
00:05:45,160 --> 00:05:46,720
Grandpa, I'll stay with you forever.

135
00:05:48,759 --> 00:05:49,800
Our Lijia Town

136
00:05:49,920 --> 00:05:51,000
is a poor place.

137
00:05:51,600 --> 00:05:52,639
You three sisters

138
00:05:52,800 --> 00:05:54,800
are just at the right age to study.

139
00:05:55,639 --> 00:05:56,040
By the way,

140
00:05:58,480 --> 00:05:59,920
take this money with you.

141
00:06:00,240 --> 00:06:01,800
Go learn some skills in the city.

142
00:06:02,600 --> 00:06:04,279
Grandpa is getting old,

143
00:06:04,600 --> 00:06:06,519
and I don't have much to teach you.

144
00:06:06,759 --> 00:06:07,639
You three sisters

145
00:06:08,240 --> 00:06:11,279
can't waste away in this thatched hut.

146
00:06:11,680 --> 00:06:12,240
It just so happens

147
00:06:12,480 --> 00:06:13,319
I have an old friend from my hometown

148
00:06:13,519 --> 00:06:15,040
who runs an Acrobatic troupe in the city.

149
00:06:15,439 --> 00:06:16,399
I've already written him a letter.

150
00:06:16,560 --> 00:06:17,240
Acrobatics?

151
00:06:17,480 --> 00:06:18,480
You'll go to his place,

152
00:06:18,920 --> 00:06:19,560
and from now on,

153
00:06:19,759 --> 00:06:21,480
you can learn the trade while studying.

154
00:06:21,800 --> 00:06:22,519
Acrobatics?

155
00:06:23,120 --> 00:06:24,040
What's that?

156
00:06:25,079 --> 00:06:26,079
Well, acrobatics

157
00:06:26,319 --> 00:06:29,040
is the art of body flexibility.

158
00:06:29,519 --> 00:06:30,759
As long as you learn it well,

159
00:06:31,040 --> 00:06:32,279
you'll not only build your physique,

160
00:06:32,480 --> 00:06:33,879
and be able to support yourselves.

161
00:06:34,639 --> 00:06:35,519
Interesting!

162
00:06:35,879 --> 00:06:37,279
I want to learn acrobatics in the city.

163
00:06:38,560 --> 00:06:39,079
Grandpa,

164
00:06:39,439 --> 00:06:41,360
once we've learned the skills,

165
00:06:41,560 --> 00:06:42,319
we'll come back and see you.

166
00:06:43,120 --> 00:06:43,600
Alright.

167
00:06:43,879 --> 00:06:45,680
Then it's a promise.

168
00:06:45,959 --> 00:06:46,439
Okay.

169
00:06:47,360 --> 00:06:48,600
Come on, hurry up and eat.

170
00:06:48,720 --> 00:06:49,519
Here, eat while it's hot.

171
00:06:49,759 --> 00:06:50,160
Okay.

172
00:06:58,600 --> 00:06:59,120
Okay.

173
00:06:59,399 --> 00:07:00,439
Take care on your journey.

174
00:07:09,079 --> 00:07:09,639
Let's go.

175
00:07:11,199 --> 00:07:13,160
Elder Ding used all his savings

176
00:07:13,199 --> 00:07:15,040
to send the sisters to study in the city.

177
00:07:16,160 --> 00:07:17,240
The three of us who stayed behind

178
00:07:18,240 --> 00:07:19,839
helped take care of Xiao Bao,

179
00:07:20,399 --> 00:07:22,279
and worked odd jobs to support the family.

180
00:07:24,199 --> 00:07:26,439
We were poor, but happy.

181
00:07:27,639 --> 00:07:28,720
Until that day...

182
00:07:29,560 --> 00:07:30,680
Benefactor Li came looking for us.

183
00:07:30,680 --> 00:07:31,600
What are you doing?

184
00:07:32,040 --> 00:07:32,920
I'm a Doctor.

185
00:07:33,160 --> 00:07:35,000
Healing and saving lives is my duty.

186
00:07:35,639 --> 00:07:37,160
I can't accept this consultation fee.

187
00:07:38,439 --> 00:07:39,720
This isn't a medical fee.

188
00:07:39,879 --> 00:07:41,240
It's money to buy your land.

189
00:07:41,800 --> 00:07:42,879
I want this piece of land.

190
00:07:43,000 --> 00:07:44,680
Take Xiao Bao and move out immediately.

191
00:07:46,240 --> 00:07:47,399
Why would you say that?

192
00:07:47,680 --> 00:07:49,279
I'm the only Doctor in this town.

193
00:07:49,560 --> 00:07:50,319
If I leave,

194
00:07:50,399 --> 00:07:51,680
who will treat the people here?

195
00:07:51,759 --> 00:07:54,079
If you leave, a new Doctor will come.

196
00:07:54,439 --> 00:07:55,360
You could practice medicine all your life

197
00:07:55,480 --> 00:07:56,560
and never earn this much money.

198
00:07:56,720 --> 00:07:57,240
Just take it.

199
00:07:57,720 --> 00:07:58,160
Xiao Bao.

200
00:07:59,120 --> 00:08:00,040
This is for you.

201
00:08:00,560 --> 00:08:01,439
It's made of nanmu wood.

202
00:08:01,519 --> 00:08:02,040
It won't break.

203
00:08:02,639 --> 00:08:03,560
Thank you, Brother Dazhu.

204
00:08:03,680 --> 00:08:05,720
Now I can watch puppet shows every day!

205
00:08:05,959 --> 00:08:06,519
Do you like it?

206
00:08:07,560 --> 00:08:08,120
Good boy.

207
00:08:09,279 --> 00:08:10,519
Xiao Bao, who is that?

208
00:08:11,240 --> 00:08:12,759
He passed out at our door.

209
00:08:12,920 --> 00:08:13,759
He had a knife wound.

210
00:08:14,040 --> 00:08:15,319
Grandpa healed him.

211
00:08:16,040 --> 00:08:17,720
Benefactor Li, please see yourself out.

212
00:08:18,720 --> 00:08:19,600
Take it.

213
00:08:19,600 --> 00:08:20,839
I really can't take it.

214
00:08:21,120 --> 00:08:22,079
You old fool!

215
00:08:22,439 --> 00:08:23,360
Don't push your luck!

216
00:08:24,079 --> 00:08:24,920
Let me tell you,

217
00:08:25,120 --> 00:08:26,519
I'm getting this land no matter what.

218
00:08:27,560 --> 00:08:28,480
Just you wait.

219
00:08:29,839 --> 00:08:30,519
See yourself out.

220
00:08:32,480 --> 00:08:33,039
A knife wound?

221
00:08:33,600 --> 00:08:35,120
Yeah, a knife wound.

222
00:08:38,600 --> 00:08:39,399
Grandpa.

223
00:08:39,639 --> 00:08:40,840
What do they want?

224
00:08:41,120 --> 00:08:42,080
They're so fierce.

225
00:08:42,679 --> 00:08:43,399
Don't mind them.

226
00:08:43,519 --> 00:08:44,759
He wants us to move out,

227
00:08:45,080 --> 00:08:46,000
but I don't want to.

228
00:08:46,120 --> 00:08:47,159
Brother Dazhu even specially

229
00:08:47,200 --> 00:08:48,639
made me a puppet toy.

230
00:08:48,759 --> 00:08:49,200
Look.

231
00:08:50,919 --> 00:08:51,559
Very nice, very nice.

232
00:08:51,679 --> 00:08:53,080
Come, let's go inside.

233
00:08:53,559 --> 00:08:55,279
Elder Ding and Xiao Bao not only saved us,

234
00:08:55,759 --> 00:08:56,639
they saved you too.

235
00:08:57,600 --> 00:08:59,559
How could you be so cruel to them?

236
00:08:59,919 --> 00:09:01,480
You tied Xiao Bao up for the river god,

237
00:09:01,639 --> 00:09:02,440
as a human foundation sacrifice.
